    <headline>Flood warning orange level for parts of Østlandet 2026-10-25</headline>
    <description>Water discharge is expected to increase because of rain. This may cause local flooding and erosion damage.</description>
    <instruction>Stay informed on the situation. Secure and/or move assets away from vulnerable areas (car, caravan along rivers/streams, basements).  Cleaning of drainage paths and culverts is recommended.  Keep away from rivers and streams with high flow.</instruction>
    <web>http://www.varsom.no/en/flood-and-landslide-warning-service/forecastid/584940</web>
    <contact>http://www.varsom.no/en/flood-and-landslide-warning-service/</contact>
    <parameter>
      <valueName>impacts</valueName>
      <value>There is a risk of local flooding and erosion damage in streams and smaller rivers. Flooding in densely populated areas, changes in stream and river courses, landslides and debris flows where the rainstorms hit.</value>
